OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy rain
OL,6,Fclearing at first, then dry for a
OL,7,Fbrief time before frequent showers
OL,8,Fspread east through the evening and
OL,9,Fovernight, turning heavy at times.
OL,10,FBecoming windy overnight with some
OL,11,Fgales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FStorm Boelo brings westerly
OL,14,Fsevere gales across all areas with
OL,15,Fstrongest winds near the Moray Coast
OL,16,Fin afternoon. Frequent showers or
OL,17,Flonger spells of heavy rain, drier
OL,18,Finterludes developing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
