OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fand bright morning Monday, becoming
OL,7,Fbreezy with rain later. Very windy on
OL,8,FTuesday with showers, mainly west and
OL,9,Fsome heavy. Mainly dry and bright
OL,10,FWednesday, some showers in west.
